The first scan begins with the article title but its item number is damaged by OCR. The final scan ends mid-sentence, so the translation stops at the same boundary. The scan confirms the subheading விலையைக் குறை! (“Reduce the Prices!”), which OCR read as விலையைக் சூறை. The pontiff's colloquial quoted speech is interpreted conservatively without normalising the Tamil source.
